= The New Order, Early

A bomb in the Senate district. A rumour of a Jedi plot. Within a week the Chancellor addresses a frightened Senate: the Republic, he says, must be reorganised into a safer and more secure society.

There is no vote worth the name. The Senate that gave him eight emergency powers has nothing left to refuse him with.

*The Chancellor held 8 emergency powers while the Senate's resolve was below 5. A Senate that has given away that much cannot stop him.*
